<title>SWITZERLAND: SOCCER-REVISED DRAWS FOR THE 1997-98 EUROPEAN CLUB COMPETITIONS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-REVISED DRAWS FOR THE 1997-98 EUROPEAN CLUB COMPETITIONS.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Draws for the 1997-98 European</p>
<p>soccer cup competitions made on Wednesday incorporating</p>
<p>alterations made to the draws by UEFA.</p>
<p>UEFA Cup, first preliminary round</p>
<p>First leg matches July 23; Second legs July 30</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>Dynamo Minsk (Belarus) v Kolkheti-1913 Loti (Georgia)</p>
<p>Hapoel Petah Tikvah (Israel) v Flora Tallinn (Estonia)</p>
<p>Dnipro Dnipropetrovsk (Ukraine) v Yerevan (Armenia)</p>
<p>Inkaras Kaunas (Lithuania) v Boby Brno (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>Mypa-47 Anjalankoski (Finland) v Appollon Limassol (Cyprus)</p>
<p>Inter CableTel Cardiff (Wales) v Celtic (Scotland)</p>
<p>Neuchatal Xamax (Switzerland) v Tiligul Tiraspol (Moldova)</p>
<p>Grevenmacher (Luxembourg) v Hajduk Split (Croatia)</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>Grasshoppers (Switzerland) v Coleraine (Northern Ireland)</p>
<p>Vojvodina Novi Sad (Yugoslavia) v Viking Stavanger (Norway)</p>
<p>KR Reykjavik (Iceland) v Dinamo Bucharest (Romania)</p>
<p>Bohemians Dublin (Ireland) v Ferencvaros (Hungary)</p>
<p>Group D</p>
<p>Jablonec (Czech Republic) v Karabakh Agdam (Azerbaijan)</p>
<p>Spartak Trnava (Slovakia) v Birkirkara (Malta)</p>
<p>Odra Wodzislaw (Poland) v Podeba Prilep (Macedonia)</p>
<p>Daugava (Latvia) v Vorskla Poltava (Ukraine)</p>
<p>Group E</p>
<p>Brann Bergen (Norway) v Neftochimik Burgas (Bulgaria)</p>
<p>CE Principat (Andorra) v Dundee United (Scotland)</p>
<p>HIT Gorica (Slovenia) v Otelul Galati (Romania)</p>
<p>Ujpest (Hungary) v KI Klaksvik (Faroe Islands)</p>
<p>(concludes UEFA Cup first preliminary round)</p>
<p>European Cup Winners' Cup, Qualifying round</p>
<p>First leg matches August 14; Second legs August 28</p>
<p>Legia Warsaw (Poland) v Glenavon (Northern Ireland)</p>
<p>Cwmbran Town (Wales) v National Bucharest (Romania)</p>
<p>Zalgiris Vilnius (Lithuania) v Hapoel Beersheba (Israel)</p>
<p>Zimbru Chisinau (Moldova) v Shakhtor Donetsk (Ukraine)</p>
<p>Dinaburg Daugavpils (Latvia) v Kapaz Ganja (Azerbaijan)</p>
<p>Kilmarnock (Scotland) v Shelbourne (Ireland)</p>
<p>HJK Helsinki (Finland) v Crvena Zvezda (Red Star) Belgrade</p>
<p>(Yugoslavia)</p>
<p>Sloga Jugomagnat (Macedonia) v NK Zagreb (Croatia)</p>
<p>Vasas Budapest (Hungary) v Balzers (Liechtenstein)</p>
<p>Tallinna Sadam (Estonia) v Belshina Bobruisk (Belarus)</p>
<p>Primorje Ajdovscina (Slovenia) v Union Luxembourg</p>
<p>(Luxembourg)</p>
<p>Levski Sofia (Bulgaria) v Slovan Bratislava (Slovakia)</p>
<p>Dynamo Batumi (Georgia) v Ararat Yerevan (Armenia)</p>
<p>Hibernians (Malta) v Vestmannaeyjar (Iceland)</p>
<p>Apoel Nicosia (Cyprus) v HB Torshavn (Faroe Islands)</p>
<p>European Cup, Qualifying round</p>
<p>First leg matches July 23; Second legs July 30</p>
<p>Derry City (Ireland) v Maribor Branik (Slovenia)</p>
<p>1FC Kosice (Slovakia) v Akranes (Iceland)</p>
<p>Partizan Belgrade (Yugoslavia) v Croatia Zagreb (Croatia)</p>
<p>Valletta (Malta) v Skonto Riga (Latvia)</p>
<p>Pyunik Yerevan (Armenia) v MTK Budapest (Hungary)</p>
<p>Crusaders (Northern Ireland) v Dynamo Tbilisi (Georgia)</p>
<p>Sileks Kratovo (Macedonia) v Betar Jerusalem (Isreael)</p>
<p>Steaua Bucharest (Romania) v CSKA Sofia (Bulgaria)</p>
<p>Constructorol Chisinau (Moldova) v MPKC Mozyr (Belarus)</p>
<p>Lantana (Estonia) v Jazz Pori (Finland)</p>
<p>GI Gotu (Faroe Islands) v Rangers (Scotland)</p>
<p>Nefchi Baku (Azerbaijan) v Widzew Lodz (Poland)</p>
<p>Dynamo Kiev (Ukraine) v Barry Town (Wales)</p>
<p>Sion (Switzerland) v Jeunesse Esch (Luxembourg)</p>
<p>Anorthosis Famagusta (Cyprus) v Kareda Siauliai (Lithuania)</p>
<p>European Cup, Preliminary round</p>
<p>First leg matches August 13; Second legs August 27</p>
<p>Kosice or Akranes v Spartak Moscow (Russia)</p>
<p>Pyunik or MTK Budapest v Rosenborg Trondheim (Norway)</p>
<p>Besiktas (Turkey) v Maribor Branik or Derry City</p>
<p>Sion or Jeunesse Esch v Galatasaray (Turkey)</p>
<p>Olympiakos Pireaus (Greece) v Constructorol or MPKC Mozyr</p>
<p>SV Salzburg (Austria) v Sparta Prague (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>1FK Gothenburg (Sweden) v GI Gotu or Rangers</p>
<p>Barcelona (Spain) v Valletta or Skonto Riga</p>
<p>Brondby (Denmark) v Dynamo Kiev or Barry Town</p>
<p>Newcastle United (England) v Partizan Belgrade or Croatia</p>
<p>Zagreb</p>
<p>Feyenoord (Netherlands) v Lantana or Jazz Pori</p>
<p>Bayer Leverkusen (Germany) v Crusaders or Dynamo Tbilisi</p>
<p>Steaua Bucharest or CSKA Sofia v Paris St Germain (France)</p>
<p>Nefchi Baku or Widzew Lodz v Parma (Italy)</p>
<p>Sileks Kratovo or Betar Jerusalem v Sporting Lisbon</p>
<p>(Portugal)</p>
<p>Anorthosis Famagusta or Kareda Siauliai v Lierse SK</p>
<p>(Belgium)</p>
<p>Note: Losing 16 teams in Preliminary round enter first round</p>
<p>proper of UEFA Cup</p>
